{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Schiedamse bleekneusjes, interview 04"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41518"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nieuwendijk, C.I., Gemeentearchief Schiedam (©)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"C.I.  Nieuwendijk"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gemeentearchief Schiedam"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Mevrouw is oud-katholiek. In 1944 is ze via de christelijk-gereformeerde gemeente van Schiedam terecht gekomen in een christelijk-gereformeerd gezin met vijf kinderen in Balkbrug in Overijssel. Ze kreeg er de indruk dat de moeder van het gezin er 'niet zo blij mee was dat ik niet van hun kerk was'. Na een verblijf van zes weken in Overijssel keerde ze terug naar Schiedam, waar ze de hongerwinter meemaakte. Mede door de afwezigheid van haar vader, die als militair geïnterneerd was, was de hongerwinter voor haar, haar moeder en haar zieke jongere zusje een zeer moeilijke tijd. Na de bevrijding werd ze met een groep Schiedamse kinderen voor ongeveer drie maanden uitgezonden naar kasteel Méridon in Chevreuse (Frankrijk). Daar kreeg ze difterie.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Respondent 35. De beschrijvingen van de bijgevoegde foto's zitten in het document GV_Schiedam_gastgezin2_04_fotodocumentatie. Document GV_Schiedam_gastgezin2_04_analyse_interview bevat een analyse van het interview.<br>Het interview duurt 1 uur en 6 minuten.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Schiedam"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hongertochten"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hongerwinter"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kinderuitzending"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kinderen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Honger"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hunger"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Hungerwinter"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Children"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Childrentransport"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Churches"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primiti